{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 95, :comments ["<b>for me</b> — the sense: to destroy me from the land of the living. Until then, I will add to meditate on Your testimonies, for at every moment the secrets of Your testimonies are revealed to me, even though they have no end; therefore after it: לכל תכלה (to every end)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 119, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:40:37.904194332Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}